{
  "id": "450",
  "title": "I Don't Understand",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-02-22",
  "synopsis": "Little Yu promises to help Ben with his HSK3 studies.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/656/07f711ff9edba9b4067989e562c18b820531e3f9.mp3?1589791633",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 3: Who is Little Yu?",
    "chapter": 14,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我看不懂\n\n小雨：本，上次那本HSK3级的书你看了吗？\n本：看了。\n小雨：那本书怎么样？\n本：那本书很好，但有些地方我看不懂。\n小雨：我可以教你。\n本：真的吗？太好了！\n小雨：我把我的电话号码给你，你有什么看不懂的，可以打电话问我。\n本：太好了，小雨你真好！",
    "traditional": "我看不懂\n\n小雨：本，上次那本HSK3級的書你看了嗎？\n本：看了。\n小雨：那本書怎麼樣？\n本：那本書很好，但有些地方我看不懂。\n小雨：我可以教你。\n本：真的嗎？太好了！\n小雨：我把我的電話號碼給你，你有什麼看不懂的，可以打電話問我。\n本：太好了，小雨你真好！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Don't Understand"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：本，上次那本HSK3级的书你看了吗？",
      "traditional": "小雨：本，上次那本HSK3級的書你看了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ běn shàng cì nà běn 3 1 jí de shū nǐ kàn le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ben, did you look at that HSK3 book from last time?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：看了。",
      "traditional": "本：看了。",
      "pinyin": "běn kàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I did."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：那本书怎么样？",
      "traditional": "小雨：那本書怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nà běn shū zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: How do you like the book?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：那本书很好，但有些地方我看不懂。",
      "traditional": "本：那本書很好，但有些地方我看不懂。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà běn shū hěn hǎo dàn yǒu xiē dì fang wǒ kàn bù dǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: The book is really good, but there are some areas I don't understand."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：我可以教你。",
      "traditional": "小雨：我可以教你。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wǒ kě yǐ jiāo nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: I can teach you."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：真的吗？太好了！",
      "traditional": "本：真的嗎？太好了！",
      "pinyin": "běn zhēn de ma tài hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Really? That's great!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小雨：我把我的电话号码给你，你有什么看不懂的，可以打电话问我。",
      "traditional": "小雨：我把我的電話號碼給你，你有什麼看不懂的，可以打電話問我。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wǒ bǎ wǒ de diàn huà hào mǎ gěi nǐ nǐ yǒu shén me kàn bù dǒng de kě yǐ dǎ diàn huà wèn wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: I'll give you my phone number. If there's something you don't understand, you can call me and ask."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：太好了，小雨你真好！",
      "traditional": "本：太好了，小雨你真好！",
      "pinyin": "běn tài hǎo le xiǎo yǔ nǐ zhēn hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Fantastic! Little Yu, you're really great!"
    }
  ],
